{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sudden\" title=\"sudden\">sudden</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pull\" title=\"pull\">pull</a>."},{"definition":"Any of various <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/knot\" title=\"knot\">knots</a> used to attach a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/rope\" title=\"rope\">rope</a> to an object other than another rope."},{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fastener\" title=\"fastener\">fastener</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/connection\" title=\"connection\">connection</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/point\" title=\"point\">point</a>, as for a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/trailer\" title=\"trailer\">trailer</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"His truck sported a heavy-duty <b>hitch</b> for his boat."}],"examples":["His truck sported a heavy-duty <b>hitch</b> for his boat."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt14\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/problem\" title=\"problem\">problem</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/delay\" title=\"delay\">delay</a> or source of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/difficulty\" title=\"difficulty\">difficulty</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The banquet went off <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/without_a_hitch#English\" title=\"without a hitch\">without a <b>hitch</b></a>","translation":"The banquet went smoothly."}],"examples":["The banquet went off <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/without_a_hitch#English\" title=\"without a hitch\">without a <b>hitch</b></a>"]},{"definition":"A hidden or unfavorable <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/condition\" title=\"condition\">condition</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/element\" title=\"element\">element</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The deal sounds too good to be true. What's the <b>hitch</b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"}],