ple":"He <b>hitched</b> the bedroll to his backpack and went camping."}],"examples":["He <b>hitched</b> the bedroll to his backpack and went camping."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt116\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/marry\" title=\"marry\">marry</a> oneself to; especially to <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/get_hitched\" title=\"get hitched\">get hitched</a></i>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt118\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt119\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#clipping\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">Clipping</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hitchhike#English\" title=\"hitchhike\">hitchhike</a></i></span></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:English_clippings#HITCH\" about=\"#mwt119\">, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/thumb_a_ride\" title=\"thumb a ride\">thumb a ride</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"to <b>hitch</b> a ride"}],"examples":["to <b>hitch</b> a ride"]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt122\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To become <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/entangle\" title=\"entangle\">entangled</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/caught\" title=\"caught\">caught</a>; to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/link\" title=\"link\">linked</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/yoke\" title=\"yoke\">yoked</a>; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/unite\" title=\"unite\">unite</a>; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cling\" title=\"cling\">cling</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt124\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To move <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/interruptedly\" title=\"interruptedly\">interruptedly</a> or with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/halt\" title=\"halt\">halts</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/jerk\" title=\"jerk\">jerks</a>, or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/step\" title=\"step\">steps</a>; said of something obstructed or impeded.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Frank’s breath <b>hitched</b> in his throat when he saw the knife being pointed at him."}],"examples":["Frank’s breath <b>hitched</b> in his throat when he saw the knife being pointed at him."]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt128\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To strike the legs together in going, as horses; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/interfere\" title=\"interfere\">interfere</a>."}]}]}